    "1": "[resources/work-templates/assets/sales/solution-cost-output-template.md#solution-cost-review-scr-output]\n\n# Solution Cost Review (SCR) Output\n\n<!-- BREADCRUMB PLACEHOLDER -->\n\n---\n\n> **TEMPLATE USAGE**: This is an output template for SCR decision recording. The AI Reviewer and ITO team use this template to document their review findings, readiness assessment, and recommendations for infrastructure sizing.\n\n---",
    "2": "[resources/work-templates/assets/sales/solution-cost-output-template.md#table-of-contents]\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n1. [Review Information](#1-review-information)\n2. [Project Information](#2-project-information)\n3. [Solution Overview & Architecture](#3-solution-overview--architecture)\n4. [Compute & Storage Assessment](#4-compute--storage-assessment)\n5. [DR & Availability Assessment](#5-dr--availability-assessment)\n6. [Security & Compliance Assessment](#6-security--compliance-assessment)\n7. [Networking Assessment](#7-networking-assessment)\n8. [Data Migration & Licensing Assessment](#8-data-migration--licensing-assessment)\n9. [Cross-Section Consistency](#9-cross-section-consistency)\n10. [Conditions and Requirements](#10-conditions-and-requirements)\n11. [Next Steps](#11-next-steps)\n\n---",
    "3": "[resources/work-templates/assets/sales/solution-cost-output-template.md#1-review-information]\n\n## 1. Review Information\n\n| Field                  | Value                                                                 |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Review Date**        | [Date of review]                                                      |\n| **Review Type**        | [Initial Review, Re-review]                                           |\n| **Previous Reviews**   | [Links to any prior review outputs]                                   |\n| **GainwellNow Number** | [GainwellNow Number]                                                  |\n| **Template Version**   | 1.0                                                                   |",
    "4": "[resources/work-templates/assets/sales/solution-cost-output-template.md#reviewers]\n\n## Reviewers\n\n| Name              | Role                             | Department              | Present | Decision |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------- | ------- | -------- |\n| AI Automation Reviewer | AI Review Service 1.0.0 | Enterprise Architecture | [ ]     | [Ready, Incomplete, Rejected] |\n| Dave Arter        | EA ITO Domain Lead               | ITO Team                | [ ]     | [ ]      |\n| [NAME]            | Solution Architect               | [DEPARTMENT]            | [ ]     | [ ]      |\n| [NAME]            | ITO Sizing Engineer              | ITO Team                | [ ]     | [ ]      |",
    "5": "[resources/work-templates/assets/sales/solution-cost-output-template.md#overall-decision]\n\n### Overall Decision\n\n- [ ] **READY FOR ITO SIZING** - Submission contains sufficient information for cost estimation\n- [ ] **INCOMPLETE — REQUIRES ADDITIONAL INFORMATION** - Gaps must be addressed before ITO can proceed\n- [ ] **REJECTED** - Submission does not meet minimum requirements",
